                                                "sense_id": "ffb49dd8-a7a0-35f1-bbad-fffaa63cfebf",
                                                "text": "Applying the term ‘ovary’ to the female gonad, he contended that the ovum played the key role in reproduction, launching the ‘ovist’ school of thought, and giving rise to fierce embryological controversy."
